#version 450
// [TL2] DM_GFX_SCENE_SCALE: edge-adaptive spatial upsampling, the EASU pass of AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FsrEasuF,
// 32-bit path of ffx_fsr1.h, ported to plain GLSL; see docs/THIRD_PARTY.md). The scene was drawn into the top-left s*W x s*H
// rectangle of its own W x H image; this expands that rectangle to the whole W x H into an RGBA16F temp image, which the engine
// then blits back 1:1 (namespace sscale in xbg_game.cpp). Alpha is not part of EASU: it is taken bilinearly at the same point.
// Regenerate xbg_easu_spv.h after editing this file (the command is at the top of that file).
//
